Super Bowl
In Super Bowl LII , the Philadelphia Eagles defeated the New England Patriots , 41 -- 33 . It was the Eagles ' third Super Bowl appearance , and their first win in franchise history . It was the Patriots ' tenth Super Bowl appearance , and their fourth appearance in ten years ; had the Patriots won , they would have tied the Pittsburgh Steelers with the most Super Bowl wins ( six ) . Missouri
